      "id": "claim_2643f5c5680949979a7ae9b6302fae35",
      "statement": "Export writes a custom-format dump with `--strict-names` (fails if table missing), uses a `.partial` file that replaces the target only on success, and refuses to overwrite existing files without `--overwrite`.",
